#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:5
msgid "Reference lists"
msgstr "Referenčni seznami"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:7
msgid "Several lists are used all over Galette: the statuses of the members, the kinds of contributions, the payment types, the titles. Galette comes with ready to use values, that you can adapt to your association from the **Configuration** menu."
msgstr ""
"V Galette se uporablja več seznamov: statusi članov, vrste prispevkov, vrste "
"plačil, nazivi. Galette ima že pripravljene vrednosti, ki jih lahko "
"prilagodite svoji povezavi v meniju **Konfiguracija**."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:9
msgid "All those lists work the same way:"
msgstr "Vsi ti seznami delujejo na enak način:"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:11
msgid "the last line of the list, or the **Add** button, adds a new entry,"
msgstr "zadnja vrstica seznama ali gumb **Dodaj** doda nov vnos,"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:12
msgid "the edit icon of the **Actions** column changes an entry,"
msgstr "ikona za urejanje v stolpcu **Dejanja** spremeni vnos,"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:13
msgid "for statuses, contribution types and payment types, the translation icon opens **Translate labels**, to give the entry a name in every language your members use,"
msgstr ""
"za statuse, vrste prispevkov in vrste plačil ikona za prevod odpre **Prevedi "
"oznake**, da vnosu date ime v vseh jezikih, ki jih uporabljajo vaši člani,"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:14
msgid "the delete icon removes an entry. An entry that is still in use, for example a status still given to some members, cannot be deleted."
msgstr ""
"ikona za brisanje odstrani vnos. Vnosa, ki je še vedno v uporabi, na primer "
"status, ki je še vedno dodeljen nekaterim članom, ni mogoče izbrisati."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:19
#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:25
msgid "User statuses"
msgstr "Stanja uporabnikov"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:21
msgid "**Configuration**, then **User statuses**."
msgstr "**Konfiguracija**, nato **Statusi uporabnikov**."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:23
msgid "The status tells the role of a member in your association: president, treasurer, active member, benefactor member... Each member has one status."
msgstr ""
"Status pove kakšno vlogo ima član v vašem društvu: predsednik, blagajnik, "
"aktivni član, dobrotnik ... Vsak član ima en status."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:30
msgid "Each status has a **name** and a **priority**. The priority orders the statuses in the lists, and it decides who belongs to the staff:"
msgstr ""
"Vsak status ima **ime** in **prioriteto**. Prioriteta ureja statuse na "
"seznamih in odloča o tem, kdo pripada osebju:"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:34
msgid "Members with a status priority lower than 30 are **staff members**: they can manage members, contributions and mailings. With the default statuses, this is the case for the president, the vice-president, the treasurer and the secretary."
msgstr ""
"Člani s prioriteto statusa, nižjo od 30, so **člani osebja**: upravljajo "
"lahko člane, prispevke in poštna sporočila. Pri privzetih statusih to velja "
"za predsednika, podpredsednika, blagajnika in tajnika."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:36
msgid "See :ref:`rights <man_generalites>` for what staff members can do."
msgstr ""
"Oglejte si :ref:`rights <man_generalites>` za informacije o tem, kaj lahko "
"delajo člani osebja."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:38
msgid "The **Non-member** status is given to new members unless another **Default membership status** is set in the :ref:`preferences <man_preferences>`; it cannot be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Status **Nečlan** dobijo novi člani, razen če je v :ref:`preferences "
"<man_preferences>` nastavljen drug **Privzeti status članstva**; ni ga "
"mogoče izbrisati."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:43
#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:49
msgid "Contributions types"
msgstr "Vrste prispevkov"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:45
msgid "**Configuration**, then **Contributions types**."
msgstr "**Konfiguracija**, nato **Vrste prispevkov**."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:47
msgid "Contribution types describe what your members pay: annual fee, reduced fee, donation..."
msgstr ""
"Vrste prispevkov opisujejo, kaj plačajo vaši člani: letna pristojbina, "
"znižana pristojbina, donacija ..."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:54
msgid "Each type has:"
msgstr "Vsak tip ima:"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:56
msgid "a **name**,"
msgstr "**ime**,"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:57
msgid "a **description**, to explain for example who the type is meant for,"
msgstr "**opis**, ki na primer pojasni, komu je tip namenjen,"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:58
msgid "an **amount**: when a contribution of that type is added, this amount is proposed, and can still be changed. Leave it empty if the amount varies,"
msgstr ""
"**znesek**: ko je dodan prispevek te vrste, je ta znesek predlagan in ga je "
"še vedno mogoče spremeniti. Pustite prazno, če se znesek spreminja,"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:59
msgid "a **membership extension**: whether a contribution of that type extends the membership of the member."
msgstr ""
"**podaljšanje članstva**: ali prispevek te vrste podaljšuje članstvo člana."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:61
msgid "Editing a contribution type"
msgstr "Urejanje vrste prispevka"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:66
msgid "The choices of **Membership extension** depend on the **Default membership extension** set in the :ref:`preferences <man_preferences>`:"
msgstr ""
"Izbire **Razširitve članstva** so odvisne od **Privzete razširitve "
"članstva**, nastavljene v :ref:`preferences <man_preferences>`:"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:68
msgid "**Default**: the membership is extended by the default duration, 12 months for example,"
msgstr ""
"**Privzeto**: članstvo se podaljša za privzeto trajanje, na primer 12 "
"mesecev,"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:69
msgid "a number of months: the membership is extended by that duration instead; use it for a monthly or quarterly membership,"
msgstr ""
"število mesecev: namesto tega se članstvo podaljša za to obdobje; uporabite "
"za mesečno ali četrtletno članstvo,"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:70
msgid "**No**: the contribution does not extend the membership. This is what donations use."
msgstr ""
"**Ne**: prispevek ne podaljšuje članstva. To je tisto, kar uporabljajo "
"donacije."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:72
msgid "When no default membership extension is set (because all memberships start on the same day of the year), the choices are only **Yes** and **No**."
msgstr ""
"Če privzeto podaljšanje članstva ni nastavljeno (ker se vsa članstva začnejo "
"na isti dan v letu), sta na voljo samo **Da** in **Ne**."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:74
msgid "See :doc:`contributions management <contributions>` to record contributions."
msgstr ""
"Za beleženje prispevkov glejte :doc:`upravljanje prispevkov <contributions>`."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:79
#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:85
msgid "Payment types"
msgstr "Vrste plačil"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:81
msgid "**Configuration**, then **Payment types**."
msgstr "**Konfiguracija**, nato **Vrste plačila**."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:83
msgid "Payment types are the ways your members pay: cash, check, credit card, transfer..."
msgstr ""
"Vrste plačil so načini plačila vaših članov: gotovina, ček, kreditna "
"kartica, nakazilo ..."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:90
msgid "You can add your own, for example a local currency or holiday vouchers. The payment types provided with Galette can be renamed or translated, but not deleted: some of them are used by Galette itself, like **Payment schedule** for :ref:`scheduled payments <scheduled_payments>`, or by plugins."
msgstr ""
"Dodate lahko svoje, na primer lokalno valuto ali počitniške bone. Vrste "
"plačil, ki jih ponuja Galette, je mogoče preimenovati ali prevesti, ne pa "
"tudi izbrisati: nekatere od njih uporablja Galette sama, na primer "
"**Razpored plačil** za :ref:`načrtovana plačila <scheduled_payments>` ali "
"vtičniki."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:95
#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:101
msgid "Titles"
msgstr "Naslovi"

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:97
msgid "**Configuration**, then **Titles**."
msgstr "**Konfiguracija**, nato **Naslovi**."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:99
msgid "Titles are displayed before the name of the members: Mr., Mrs...."
msgstr "Nazivi so prikazani pred imeni članov: g., ga...."

#: ../usermanual/reference_lists.rst:106
msgid "Each title has a **short form** (*Mr.*), displayed before the name of the members, and an optional **long form** (*Mister*). **Mr.** and **Mrs.** cannot be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Vsak naziv ima **kratko obliko** (*gospod*), prikazano pred imenom članov, "
"in neobvezno **dolgo obliko** (*gospod*). **G.** in **Gospa.** ni mogoče "
"izbrisati."
